// Flora kit v0 (genesis design §7): authored once for all planets, never per
// planet. Low-poly profile (§4.6 rule 4): shapes only, no textures; tint comes
// from the species look (later the G1 palette).
//
// Shape frame: x runs from the attachment point (0) to the tip (1), y across,
// z is the face normal (the side that faces the light). Unit length; the
// grower scales by organ_size_m / fruit_size_m. Triangles are counter-clockwise
// seen from +z; the renderer draws organs two-sided.
